      "EpisodeMasterId": 2006602,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 4,
      "SpeakerName": "银河座上层A",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "拉莫娜·沃尔芙，今天把你叫来，不为别的。/n听说你最近又在过度干涉其他演员？",
      "VoiceFileName": "20066020030",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 2006602005,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 2006602,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 5,
      "SpeakerName": "银河座上层B",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "工作坊之后又来这一出，动作还真快。/n托你的福，我们不得不开这么一场会议。",
      "VoiceFileName": "20066020040",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 2006602006,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 2006602,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 6,
      "SpeakerName": "拉莫娜",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "（果然……是这样。上层希望的，/n　大概是让剧团内部恢复到我刚来时的银河座吧）",
      "VoiceFileName": "20066020050",
      "CharacterMotions": [
        {
          "slotNumber": 1,
          "FacialExpressionMasterId": 73,
          "BodyMotionMasterId": 25,
          "SpineId": 30201,
          "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
          "CharacterPosition": 3,
          "CharacterLayerType": 1,
          "SpineSize": 2
        }
      ],
      "SpeakerIconId": "302"
    },
    {
      "Id": 2006602007,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 2006602,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 7,
      "SpeakerName": "拉莫娜",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "（我并不觉得自己是在和大家抱团取暖……但在上层看来，/n　我的行为被归到那一类也不奇怪）",
      "VoiceFileName": "20066020060",
      "CharacterMotions": [
        {
          "slotNumber": 1,
          "FacialExpressionMasterId": 400,
          "BodyMotionMasterId": 3,
          "SpineId": 30201,
          "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
          "CharacterPosition": 3,
          "CharacterLayerType": 1,
          "SpineSize": 2
        }
      ],
      "SpeakerIconId": "302"
    },
    {
      "Id": 2006602008,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 2006602,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 8,
      "SpeakerName": "拉莫娜",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "这是误会。工作坊那件事发生在那种局面下。/n不得不那么处理……这点我也理解。",
      "VoiceFileName": "20066020070",
      "CharacterMotions": [
        {
          "slotNumber": 1,
          "FacialExpressionMasterId": 100,
          "BodyMotionMasterId": 15,
          "LipSyncMasterId": 4,
          "SpineId": 30201,
          "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
          "CharacterPosition": 3,
          "CharacterLayerType": 1,
          "SpineSize": 2
        }
      ],
      "SpeakerIconId": "302"
    },
    {
      "Id": 2006602009,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 2006602,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 9,
      "SpeakerName": "拉莫娜",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "现在我去听大家的烦恼，也是因为我认为帮助那些迷茫的人，/n就是我能为整个剧团做的事——",
      "VoiceFileName": "20066020080",
      "CharacterMotions": [
        {
          "slotNumber": 1,
          "FacialExpressionMasterId": 79,
          "BodyMotionMasterId": 13,
          "LipSyncMasterId": 4,
          "SpineId": 30201,
          "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
          "CharacterPosition": 3,
          "CharacterLayerType": 1,
          "SpineSize": 2
        }
      ],
      "SpeakerIconId": "302"
    },
    {
      "Id": 2006602010,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 2006602,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 10,
      "SpeakerName": "银河座上层A",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "即使你本人没有那个意思，也会对周围的人造成影响。/n这点你应该也明白吧？",
      "VoiceFileName": "20066020090",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 2006602011,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 2006602,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 11,
      "SpeakerName": "拉莫娜",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "那是……。",
      "VoiceFileName": "20066020100",
      "CharacterMotions": [
        {
          "slotNumber": 1,
          "FacialExpressionMasterId": 400,
          "BodyMotionMasterId": 25,
          "LipSyncMasterId": 4,
          "SpineId": 30201,
          "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
          "CharacterPosition": 3,
          "CharacterLayerType": 1,
          "SpineSize": 2
        }
      ],
      "SpeakerIconId": "302"
    },
    {
      "Id": 2006602012,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 2006602,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 12,
      "SpeakerName": "拉莫娜",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "（我……明白。他们想说的，/n　就是工作坊参与者被解雇的事吧）",
      "VoiceFileName": "20066020110",
      "CharacterMotions": [
        {
          "slotNumber": 1,
          "FacialExpressionMasterId": 73,
          "SpineId": 30201,
          "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
          "CharacterPosition": 3,
          "CharacterLayerType": 1,
          "SpineSize": 2
        }
      ],
      "SpeakerIconId": "302"
    },
    {
      "Id": 2006602013,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 2006602,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 13,
      "SpeakerName": "拉莫娜",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "（那些因为我而被迫离开的人。/n　如今《桥弁庆》已经结束，这份重量反倒姗姗来迟地压在肩上）",
      "VoiceFileName": "20066020120",
      "CharacterMotions": [
        {
          "slotNumber": 1,
          "FacialExpressionMasterId": 400,
          "SpineId": 30201,
          "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
          "CharacterPosition": 3,
          "CharacterLayerType": 1,
          "SpineSize": 2
        }
      ],
      "SpeakerIconId": "302"
    },
    {
      "Id": 2006602014,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 2006602,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 14,
      "SpeakerName": "拉莫娜",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "（我明明曾经发誓，不会再像卡特莉娜那时一样，/n　因为自己的任性而让别人受到伤害）",
      "VoiceFileName": "20066020130",
      "CharacterMotions": [
        {
          "slotNumber": 1,
          "FacialExpressionMasterId": 74,
          "BodyMotionMasterId": 13,
          "SpineId": 30201,
          "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
          "CharacterPosition": 3,
          "CharacterLayerType": 1,
          "SpineSize": 2
        }
      ],
      "SpeakerIconId": "302"
    },
    {
      "Id": 2006602015,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 2006602,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 15,
      "SpeakerName": "银河座上层B",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "你是已经多次以主要演员身份登台的人。/n如果你对自己的影响力毫无自觉，我们会很困扰。",
      "VoiceFileName": "20066020140",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 2006602016,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 2006602,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 16,
      "SpeakerName": "银河座上层B",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "这无疑是将来可能摧毁银河座的扭曲。/n像现在的你这样的不安定因素，不能放任不管。",
      "VoiceFileName": "20066020150",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 2006602017,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 2006602,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 17,
      "SpeakerName": "拉莫娜",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "……！/n这……！",
      "VoiceFileName": "20066020160",
      "CharacterMotions": [
        {
          "slotNumber": 1,
          "FacialExpressionMasterId": 506,
          "BodyMotionMasterId": 13,
          "LipSyncMasterId": 4,
          "SpineId": 30201,
          "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
          "CharacterPosition": 3,
          "CharacterLayerType": 1,
